      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wheeler%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s origins trace back to 1904 when ranchers Robert B. and his partner founded Wheeler.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
