      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.wheelertexas.org/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Wheeler serves as the county seat of Wheeler County, sitting on the eastern edge of the Texas Panhandle.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
